      "@id": "kt:langgraph",
      "@type": "kto:Tool",
      "skos:prefLabel": "LangGraph",
      "skos:definition": "An open-source, low-level orchestration framework and runtime from LangChain for building long-running, stateful LLM agents and workflows as graphs of shared state, nodes and edges, with built-in checkpointing, human-in-the-loop interrupts and streaming; its execution model is adapted from Google's Pregel.",
