      "@id": "kt:diffusion-model",
      "@type": "kto:Architecture",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Diffusion model",
      "skos:definition": "A class of generative models that learns to reverse a gradual noising process: data are progressively corrupted with Gaussian noise, and a neural network is trained to denoise step by step, so that new samples can be generated by starting from pure noise and iteratively removing it.",
