      "@id": "kt:bm25",
      "@type": "kto:Algorithm",
      "skos:prefLabel": "BM25",
      "skos:definition": "A lexical ranking function from the probabilistic relevance framework that scores a document by summing, over the query terms it contains, an inverse-document-frequency weight multiplied by a saturating, length-normalized term-frequency factor.",
